{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id458080128"}, "name":{"label":"Saul Vader"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-08T00:55:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12632330631"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing app with one fatal flaw"}, "content":{"label":"First of all, this app does something which apple screen time doesn’t, which is when an app is blocked, you can’t just click “Ignore limit for today”, you have to actually open the app to take a picture of grass. However, I have found that I can just open the app and remove the app(s) I want to use from the distracting apps section, meaning it can easily be bypassed. I would like the app to be updated so you cannot remove apps from the list while the block is active but you can still add them, I feel like this addition would make me much more productive.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
